\begin_layout Standard
Calculations done for 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha$
\end_inset

 in (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sub:calcgraddoublestaralpha"

\end_inset

) are also valid for 
